Subject: [PATCH 32/78] Port fifty H027 effect handlers of the H005+$2832 table

Handlers for effects 1-3, 8-$A, $F, $11, $14, $15, $19, $1C, $1D, $21,
$22, $24, $25, $27, $2A, $2F, $32, $36, $38, $39, $3B, $3F, $49, $4A,
$59-$65, $6A-$6F, $76, $77, the empty ones and the magic item vector
$2A0E, with H027+$02BE; H062+$15C6 moves to h062.c.

